Dialogue: 2,0:00:01.60,0:00:02.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,今天要出門
Dialogue: 2,0:00:05.90,0:00:07.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是要準備多久啊
Dialogue: 2,0:00:07.97,0:00:09.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,別催了 真煩
Dialogue: 2,0:00:09.95,0:00:12.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,誰叫你一要出門就拖拖拉拉
Dialogue: 2,0:00:13.77,0:00:16.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,大量未登錄人物接近中
Dialogue: 2,0:00:20.07,0:00:21.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你們是誰啊？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:21.47,0:00:22.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,打擾了！
Dialogue: 2,0:00:22.95,0:00:26.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,神里緣司博士 夜羽雀博士
Dialogue: 2,0:00:26.52,0:00:28.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,還有通稱“少女型武器”
Dialogue: 2,0:00:28.62,0:00:29.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪 對吧
Dialogue: 2,0:00:31.80,0:00:33.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,難道你們是大學的…
Dialogue: 2,0:00:33.50,0:00:35.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不對 是學會的人嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:36.07,0:00:37.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,現在過來是想幹嘛！
Dialogue: 2,0:00:37.92,0:00:39.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,研究“擁有心靈的AI”
Dialogue: 2,0:00:40.27,0:00:43.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,開發“彷彿真人的人形機器人”
Dialogue: 2,0:00:43.80,0:00:45.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,太了不起了！
Dialogue: 2,0:00:45.15,0:00:45.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,什…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.94,0:01:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（阿爾瑪醬想成為家人）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.32,0:02:20.82,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（搭載人工智慧少女型武器調查報告）
Dialogue: 2,0:02:21.65,0:02:24.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,前幾天讓巨大不明生物無法行動
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.65,0:02:25.52,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（“想成為家人”）
Dialogue: 2,0:02:25.00,0:02:27.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,遇難太空人的生還
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.52,0:02:26.75,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（SPACE YO-JO? ZASA提供 得救後訪問 麥特托拉斯）
Dialogue: 2,0:02:27.90,0:02:29.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,還有颱風消失的事
Dialogue: 2,0:02:29.62,0:02:31.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,報告指出這些事都與她有關
Dialogue: 2,0:02:32.12,0:02:33.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我們學會
Dialogue: 2,0:02:33.80,0:02:36.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對你們的研究給予極高的評價
Dialogue: 2,0:02:36.87,0:02:38.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,打算撤回以前的判斷
Dialogue: 2,0:02:38.62,0:02:41.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,讓你們加入
Dialogue: 2,0:02:41.57,0:02:43.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我們在美國準備了實驗室
Dialogue: 2,0:02:43.97,0:02:46.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,匯集了最先進的技術與優秀助手
Dialogue: 2,0:02:46.75,0:02:50.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,還有主任的職位與優厚待遇
Dialogue: 2,0:02:50.77,0:02:53.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,來吧！請一定要加入我們！
Dialogue: 2,0:02:54.25,0:02:57.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那時候還否定我們
Dialogue: 2,0:02:57.55,0:02:59.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,態度變得可真快啊
Dialogue: 2,0:02:59.72,0:03:01.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,而且還把阿爾瑪當成物品看待
Dialogue: 2,0:03:02.22,0:03:05.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我們才不會照你們的意思去做！
Dialogue: 2,0:03:06.47,0:03:07.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,全部都快給我…
Dialogue: 2,0:03:07.57,0:03:08.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 2,0:03:08.85,0:03:09.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 2,0:03:10.50,0:03:12.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我們去美國吧
Dialogue: 2,0:03:12.27,0:03:12.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪？
Dialogue: 2,0:03:13.65,0:03:17.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,讓當初否定研究的人刮目相看和認同
Dialogue: 2,0:03:17.40,0:03:19.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是兩位的夢想吧
Dialogue: 2,0:03:19.37,0:03:20.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 2,0:03:21.37,0:03:22.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對呀…
Dialogue: 2,0:03:22.90,0:03:23.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,既然這樣
Dialogue: 2,0:03:23.82,0:03:26.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我希望能實現你們的夢想
Dialogue: 2,0:03:26.50,0:03:27.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪
Dialogue: 2,0:03:28.02,0:03:29.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好… 好！
Dialogue: 2,0:03:29.72,0:03:32.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這種時候猶豫的話一點也不像我們！
Dialogue: 2,0:03:34.75,0:03:35.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 2,0:03:35.90,0:03:38.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,只有毫不猶豫抓住\N機會的人才能有成就
Dialogue: 2,0:03:39.45,0:03:40.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,走吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:03:40.40,0:03:41.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,去美國！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.65,0:04:00.07,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（潛水深度1028.0m）
Dialogue: 2,0:04:06.70,0:04:07.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\an8}真驚人
Dialogue: 2,0:04:07.35,0:04:08.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\an8}太棒了
Dialogue: 2,0:04:08.42,0:04:09.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\an8}不敢相信
Dialogue: 2,0:04:09.55,0:04:11.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\an8}請幫助我們的專案
Dialogue: 2,0:04:12.17,0:04:14.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\an8}價格隨你開
Dialogue: 2,0:04:14.72,0:04:16.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\an8}這不可能
Dialogue: 2,0:04:20.05,0:04:22.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,唉呀 愉快愉快
Dialogue: 2,0:04:22.52,0:04:23.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那些高層老頭
Dialogue: 2,0:04:23.87,0:04:25.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,眼珠都快掉下來了
Dialogue: 2,0:04:25.65,0:04:27.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,多虧阿爾瑪展現了這麼多
Dialogue: 2,0:04:28.17,0:04:29.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,進展很順利呢
Dialogue: 2,0:04:30.22,0:04:31.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 2,0:04:34.87,0:04:36.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,很棒的咖啡豆
Dialogue: 2,0:04:37.07,0:04:38.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,雖然一開始完全沒打算
Dialogue: 2,0:04:39.10,0:04:40.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但現在覺得來這裡是對的
Dialogue: 2,0:04:41.32,0:04:44.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,, 話說回來
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.50,0:04:53.50,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（8750m² 等同於35棟阿爾瑪研究所）
Dialogue: 2,0:04:59.60,0:05:02.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,雖然他們說這些隨便我們使用
Dialogue: 2,0:05:02.17,0:05:03.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,車子還算正常
Dialogue: 2,0:05:03.62,0:05:05.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但直升機就…
Dialogue: 2,0:05:05.65,0:05:07.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪 不會冷嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:05:07.75,0:05:09.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯 這是溫水游泳池
Dialogue: 2,0:05:10.35,0:05:11.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 2,0:05:11.82,0:05:14.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,而且有噴射裝置 可以玩水呢
Dialogue: 2,0:05:15.45,0:05:16.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我也要？
Dialogue: 2,0:05:17.85,0:05:20.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,想和爸爸媽媽一起玩
Dialogue: 2,0:05:21.80,0:05:24.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好啦我知道啦 下次放假再說吧
Dialogue: 2,0:05:25.42,0:05:25.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 2,0:05:26.52,0:05:27.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,喔
Dialogue: 2,0:05:28.20,0:05:29.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,得出門了
Dialogue: 2,0:05:30.12,0:05:31.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 2,0:05:31.92,0:05:34.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那我去上學了
Dialogue: 2,0:05:34.55,0:05:35.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,喔…
Dialogue: 2,0:05:35.95,0:05:36.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,路上小心
Dialogue: 2,0:05:37.25,0:05:37.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 2,0:05:42.45,0:05:43.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪她
Dialogue: 2,0:05:43.70,0:05:46.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,因為家裡有事搬家去美國了
Dialogue: 2,0:05:46.72,0:05:49.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,咦？怎麼會
Dialogue: 2,0:05:49.97,0:05:52.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但她沒有轉學
Dialogue: 2,0:05:52.75,0:05:53.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 2,0:05:53.60,0:05:54.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我會遠程上課
Dialogue: 2,0:05:55.20,0:05:56.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,以後也請多多指教
Dialogue: 2,0:05:58.20,0:05:59.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,什麼嘛 太好了
Dialogue: 2,0:06:01.27,0:06:03.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那開始上課囉
Dialogue: 2,0:06:03.72,0:06:05.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,來發表上週的作文
Dialogue: 2,0:06:05.92,0:06:08.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,“最喜歡的人”
Dialogue: 2,0:06:08.97,0:06:10.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,咦咦
Dialogue: 2,0:06:13.07,0:06:14.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪唸吧
Dialogue: 2,0:06:14.87,0:06:15.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 2,0:06:18.27,0:06:19.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,“我最喜歡的人”
Dialogue: 2,0:06:20.50,0:06:22.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我的重要資料夾裡面
Dialogue: 2,0:06:22.25,0:06:23.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,有很多人
Dialogue: 2,0:06:24.07,0:06:26.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,其中資料最多的人是
Dialogue: 2,0:06:26.70,0:06:28.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,爸爸和媽媽
Dialogue: 2,0:06:29.30,0:06:31.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這次基於他們兩位的證言
Dialogue: 2,0:06:32.05,0:06:34.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,重現過去的景象
Dialogue: 2,0:06:34.62,0:06:35.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,厲害
Dialogue: 2,0:06:37.90,0:06:39.19,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,{\an8}（國小時代）
Dialogue: 2,0:06:39.85,0:06:40.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,他們兩人
Dialogue: 2,0:06:40.72,0:06:42.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,自小就被稱為神童
Dialogue: 2,0:06:43.05,0:06:45.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,開始了機器人的研究
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.92,0:06:46.75,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（國中時代）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.95,0:06:49.50,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（高中時代）
Dialogue: 2,0:06:48.55,0:06:49.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,行為都沒變嘛
Dialogue: 2,0:06:50.35,0:06:52.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,合力製作機器人不就好了嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:06:53.42,0:06:55.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就算沒有借助這傢伙的能力
Dialogue: 2,0:06:55.95,0:06:58.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我的AI已經夠優秀了
Dialogue: 2,0:06:58.60,0:06:59.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,緣司的機器人
Dialogue: 2,0:07:00.00,0:07:01.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不怎麼可愛啊
Dialogue: 2,0:07:04.27,0:07:07.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我的機器人又可愛又強 是無敵的喔
Dialogue: 2,0:07:07.97,0:07:09.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不是常常爆炸嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:07:18.32,0:07:19.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 2,0:07:19.37,0:07:23.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,要是我哪天竟然真的輸給妳的話
Dialogue: 2,0:07:23.82,0:07:28.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我就幫妳做連人類\N都比不上的超強 AI
Dialogue: 2,0:07:28.40,0:07:31.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那麼你可能會喜歡的
Dialogue: 2,0:07:31.30,0:07:33.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,世界上最可愛最棒的機器人
Dialogue: 2,0:07:33.87,0:07:35.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我就為你做一台吧
Dialogue: 2,0:07:35.77,0:07:38.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這樣的兩個人遇到了危機
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.02,0:07:40.12,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（大學時代）
Dialogue: 2,0:07:40.95,0:07:43.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,先進的研究得不到認同
Dialogue: 2,0:07:43.75,0:07:45.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,被學會排擠了
Dialogue: 2,0:07:47.05,0:07:48.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,爸爸和媽媽
Dialogue: 2,0:07:48.80,0:07:50.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,主動離開了學會
Dialogue: 2,0:07:51.12,0:07:53.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,之後兩人同心協力
Dialogue: 2,0:07:54.67,0:07:56.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,誕生了我
Dialogue: 2,0:07:58.20,0:08:01.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,由於我的能力得到學會的認可
Dialogue: 2,0:08:01.60,0:08:04.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,他們兩人的才能得到了正當的評價
Dialogue: 2,0:08:04.72,0:08:07.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我要在背後支持
Dialogue: 2,0:08:07.67,0:08:09.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,爸爸媽媽的夢想！
Dialogue: 2,0:08:13.45,0:08:14.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,一起玩吧
Dialogue: 2,0:08:15.65,0:08:16.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,完成準備了
Dialogue: 2,0:08:19.42,0:08:20.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 2,0:08:21.20,0:08:24.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪抱歉啊 好像又得熬夜了
Dialogue: 2,0:08:26.80,0:08:27.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 2,0:08:28.17,0:08:29.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,為了健康著想 就算只有片刻
Dialogue: 2,0:08:29.75,0:08:31.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,請您一定要睡覺
Dialogue: 2,0:08:31.57,0:08:32.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 2,0:08:32.60,0:08:34.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我還要再拚一下！
Dialogue: 2,0:08:37.05,0:08:37.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 2,0:08:38.55,0:08:39.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 2,0:08:39.62,0:08:41.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,今天也會較晚回去
Dialogue: 2,0:08:41.72,0:08:43.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,工作請加油！
Dialogue: 2,0:08:47.22,0:08:49.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,習慣那邊的生活了嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:08:49.97,0:08:50.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 2,0:08:50.70,0:08:53.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,研究團隊的大家也很照顧我
Dialogue: 2,0:08:54.07,0:08:56.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,爸爸有了很多部下
Dialogue: 2,0:08:56.62,0:08:58.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,看起來還挺高興的
Dialogue: 2,0:08:58.70,0:09:01.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,很容易想像呢
Dialogue: 2,0:09:01.50,0:09:04.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,媽媽每天都能隨意碰觸最新型的機器
Dialogue: 2,0:09:05.07,0:09:06.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,看起來很幸福
Dialogue: 2,0:09:06.87,0:09:08.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 2,0:09:08.60,0:09:10.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪在做什麼呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:09:10.35,0:09:11.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我負責顧家
Dialogue: 2,0:09:12.85,0:09:14.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我能夠創造東西
Dialogue: 2,0:09:14.35,0:09:16.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,無法幫忙開發方面的工作
Dialogue: 2,0:09:17.35,0:09:19.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,雖然他們兩人常常晚回家
Dialogue: 2,0:09:20.15,0:09:23.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但這代表工作非常充實
Dialogue: 2,0:09:23.65,0:09:24.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 2,0:09:25.05,0:09:26.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那兩個人
Dialogue: 2,0:09:26.17,0:09:28.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,從我的立場來看 就像常常吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:09:29.02,0:09:30.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,如果是我會很討厭
Dialogue: 2,0:09:35.50,0:09:37.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這是搭載了次世代的人工智慧
Dialogue: 2,0:09:38.20,0:09:40.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,人形機器人“家族”
Dialogue: 2,0:09:41.60,0:09:43.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,與前世代完全不同
Dialogue: 2,0:09:43.80,0:09:45.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,實現了自然的動作
Dialogue: 2,0:09:46.37,0:09:49.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,從粗重工作到精密作業、日常生活
Dialogue: 2,0:09:49.92,0:09:52.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,能從各方面支援人類！
Dialogue: 2,0:09:53.50,0:09:54.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,本開發計畫
Dialogue: 2,0:09:54.67,0:09:56.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是由日本科學家主導
Dialogue: 2,0:09:56.75,0:10:00.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,想必他們的研究日後也會得到注目吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.75,0:10:00.97,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（爸爸）
Dialogue: 2,0:10:02.85,0:10:04.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啊 爸爸！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:04.60,0:10:05.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪 抱歉啊
Dialogue: 2,0:10:06.30,0:10:08.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,累積了很多報告文件要處理
Dialogue: 2,0:10:08.67,0:10:10.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,看來得在這過夜了
Dialogue: 2,0:10:10.50,0:10:12.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,擔任負責人有夠累的啊
Dialogue: 2,0:10:12.95,0:10:14.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你又來了
Dialogue: 2,0:10:14.27,0:10:16.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,之前不是也失約了嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:10:16.47,0:10:18.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妳不也是爽約過嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:10:18.80,0:10:20.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,哇… 那是因為…
Dialogue: 2,0:10:20.80,0:10:21.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒關係的！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:25.15,0:10:28.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我很清楚兩位的行程排得非常滿
Dialogue: 2,0:10:28.57,0:10:30.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,工作請加油！
Dialogue: 2,0:10:30.97,0:10:31.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪…
Dialogue: 2,0:10:32.80,0:10:34.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,等告一段落再一起玩吧
Dialogue: 2,0:10:34.97,0:10:36.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,一定會做到的
Dialogue: 2,0:10:36.35,0:10:36.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 2,0:10:37.77,0:10:38.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那麼…
Dialogue: 2,0:10:38.67,0:10:39.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,再見
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.67,0:10:52.57,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（提醒 2月15日 阿爾瑪初次啟動日 與爸爸媽媽一起慶祝）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.90,0:11:00.95,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（提醒 2月15日 阿爾瑪初次啟動日 與爸爸媽媽一起慶祝）
Dialogue: 2,0:11:04.47,0:11:05.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,一起玩吧
Dialogue: 2,0:11:17.80,0:11:18.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 2,0:11:18.95,0:11:20.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,感謝你們一路陪我走到這裡
Dialogue: 2,0:11:21.37,0:11:22.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,後天就是
Dialogue: 2,0:11:22.22,0:11:24.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,“家族”的重要正式活動實驗的日子
Dialogue: 2,0:11:25.62,0:11:26.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,保持專注 一起撐過去吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:11:27.15,0:11:27.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,Yes Boss
Dialogue: 2,0:11:28.85,0:11:30.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,主任也很辛苦呢
Dialogue: 2,0:11:30.60,0:11:33.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,最近都沒有跟女朋友見面吧
Dialogue: 2,0:11:33.45,0:11:35.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,別亂說 不是那種…
Dialogue: 2,0:11:36.87,0:11:37.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 2,0:11:38.90,0:11:39.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,的確
Dialogue: 2,0:11:40.22,0:11:42.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,最近都沒什麼聊天
Dialogue: 2,0:11:43.02,0:11:45.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,小雀… 還有阿爾瑪
Dialogue: 2,0:11:45.32,0:11:46.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不知道她們過得好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.30,0:11:48.77,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（ROBOT CLEANER　哥哥正在求助）
Dialogue: 2,0:11:56.05,0:11:56.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,請幫幫我們
Dialogue: 2,0:11:57.60,0:12:00.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,爸爸 媽媽
Dialogue: 2,0:12:14.62,0:12:15.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,離家出走？
Dialogue: 2,0:12:16.15,0:12:16.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:12:17.60,0:12:19.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,“哥哥”傳來通知
Dialogue: 2,0:12:22.12,0:12:23.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,“守護阿爾瑪”也是
Dialogue: 2,0:12:23.95,0:12:25.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,找不到她的下落
Dialogue: 2,0:12:26.10,0:12:28.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,可是怎麼會突然不見？
Dialogue: 2,0:12:29.37,0:12:31.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪會那樣做的理由
Dialogue: 2,0:12:31.82,0:12:34.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,之前聯絡的時候 阿爾瑪…
Dialogue: 2,0:12:35.15,0:12:36.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,態度有點奇怪
Dialogue: 2,0:12:37.15,0:12:39.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,說不定是忍著寂寞
Dialogue: 2,0:12:40.45,0:12:42.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,寂寞… 阿爾瑪嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:12:43.47,0:12:44.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你敢說不是嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:12:45.57,0:12:46.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 2,0:12:47.25,0:12:49.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,各方面都更加優秀的是我才對
Dialogue: 2,0:12:49.60,0:12:50.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,很困難嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:12:53.02,0:12:55.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,瑪琪娜是我的妹妹呢
Dialogue: 2,0:12:56.52,0:12:59.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但是工作目前正在佳境
Dialogue: 2,0:13:00.32,0:13:01.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,如果能量產“家族”
Dialogue: 2,0:13:02.20,0:13:04.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,人們的生活就能變得更豐富
Dialogue: 2,0:13:04.82,0:13:07.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我們的研究能得到世界的認可
Dialogue: 2,0:13:07.95,0:13:10.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這是我們自幼的夢想！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:10.92,0:13:11.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妳不也是這樣嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:13:16.10,0:13:18.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒有賺頭的無意義研究
Dialogue: 2,0:13:18.82,0:13:19.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,白日夢
Dialogue: 2,0:13:20.85,0:13:23.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,要讓人再也說不出這句話！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:24.55,0:13:26.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我希望能實現你們的夢想
Dialogue: 2,0:13:27.95,0:13:29.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪也是這樣希望的
Dialogue: 2,0:13:30.32,0:13:31.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,現在怎麼可以離開這裡…
Dialogue: 2,0:13:31.85,0:13:33.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你在說什麼蠢話！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:37.92,0:13:38.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,小雀？
Dialogue: 2,0:13:39.40,0:13:41.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是你最先說的不是嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:13:41.87,0:13:44.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,要把阿爾瑪當成女兒對待
Dialogue: 2,0:13:44.37,0:13:45.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那是謊話嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:13:48.55,0:13:50.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,-我啊\N-這可不是普通的失敗喔
Dialogue: 2,0:13:50.82,0:13:51.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,失敗是…
Dialogue: 2,0:13:51.30,0:13:52.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不管怎麼說
Dialogue: 2,0:13:52.62,0:13:53.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你還算是不錯的爸爸
Dialogue: 2,0:13:53.97,0:13:54.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,很好！
Dialogue: 2,0:13:54.42,0:13:56.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我對你有點改觀了
Dialogue: 2,0:13:57.07,0:13:57.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,可是你
Dialogue: 2,0:14:02.77,0:14:04.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,下次能做得更好
Dialogue: 2,0:14:04.20,0:14:05.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,謝謝您擔心我
Dialogue: 2,0:14:05.55,0:14:07.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,而且一般來說的“姊姊”
Dialogue: 2,0:14:07.80,0:14:08.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 2,0:14:13.20,0:14:15.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,抱歉… 一點都不像我了啊
Dialogue: 2,0:14:17.32,0:14:19.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,去找阿爾瑪吧！幫助我們！
Dialogue: 2,0:14:20.75,0:14:22.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,交給我吧
Dialogue: 2,0:14:22.42,0:14:23.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,父親
Dialogue: 2,0:14:23.70,0:14:24.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,別叫我父親
Dialogue: 2,0:14:25.45,0:14:27.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我正在用我權限能動用的
Dialogue: 2,0:14:27.47,0:14:30.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,公司所有衛星在追蹤呢
Dialogue: 2,0:14:31.05,0:14:32.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,一定能找到的
Dialogue: 2,0:14:32.55,0:14:35.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,因為阿爾瑪是兩位最自豪的女兒
Dialogue: 2,0:14:36.95,0:14:38.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妮恩 謝謝妳
Dialogue: 2,0:14:39.25,0:14:40.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,在各地找到了
Dialogue: 2,0:14:40.85,0:14:42.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,疑似阿爾瑪的目擊影像
Dialogue: 2,0:14:43.22,0:14:44.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,夏威夷跟南極
Dialogue: 2,0:14:45.00,0:14:47.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,連宇宙的目擊情報都有
Dialogue: 2,0:14:49.20,0:14:52.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就算是我們也沒辦法去那裡
Dialogue: 2,0:14:52.70,0:14:54.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,母親 不用擔心
Dialogue: 2,0:14:55.15,0:14:57.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,有適合的人選喔！
Dialogue: 2,0:15:01.47,0:15:02.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,這邊就交給我！
Dialogue: 2,0:15:03.32,0:15:05.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,瑪琪娜 謝謝妳
Dialogue: 2,0:15:06.12,0:15:08.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,因為我不想看到沒精神的阿爾瑪！
Dialogue: 2,0:15:09.40,0:15:10.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,瑪琪娜冷靜一點
Dialogue: 2,0:15:11.25,0:15:12.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那台推進輔助器的性能
Dialogue: 2,0:15:12.90,0:15:15.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,只夠用來再次進入大氣層
Dialogue: 2,0:15:15.45,0:15:16.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒辦法長時間探索…
Dialogue: 2,0:15:16.82,0:15:17.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,知道啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:15:17.82,0:15:19.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,聽人把話說完！
Dialogue: 2,0:15:19.85,0:15:20.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,如果遇到危險
Dialogue: 2,0:15:20.95,0:15:22.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,常常就會給我指示啊！
Dialogue: 2,0:15:23.32,0:15:24.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,所以沒問題的！
Dialogue: 2,0:15:24.85,0:15:25.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,謝謝！
Dialogue: 2,0:15:25.77,0:15:27.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,謝謝妳幫忙尋找阿爾瑪
Dialogue: 2,0:15:28.85,0:15:30.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我是為了學姊！
Dialogue: 2,0:15:30.30,0:15:32.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,才不是為了瑪琪娜！
Dialogue: 2,0:15:35.95,0:15:37.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,來 大家
Dialogue: 2,0:15:37.62,0:15:39.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,今天是要讓大家知道未來…
Dialogue: 2,0:15:39.50,0:15:42.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,大哥他們去美國也好一陣子了
Dialogue: 2,0:15:43.40,0:15:45.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,大家過得好嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:15:45.82,0:15:46.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那是什麼！
Dialogue: 2,0:15:47.25,0:15:48.04,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好漂亮！
Dialogue: 2,0:16:22.00,0:16:22.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,怎樣？
Dialogue: 2,0:16:23.77,0:16:26.00,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我覺得書包適合放在這裡
Dialogue: 2,0:16:26.82,0:16:28.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒什麼嘛
Dialogue: 2,0:16:28.37,0:16:30.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,比如正確的菜刀握法…
Dialogue: 2,0:16:30.42,0:16:31.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,貓抓的手勢
Dialogue: 2,0:16:31.72,0:16:33.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,強制連線網路
Dialogue: 2,0:16:43.15,0:16:44.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,該回去了
Dialogue: 2,0:16:44.77,0:16:46.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,如果被發現我不在
Dialogue: 2,0:16:46.47,0:16:47.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,會讓那兩位擔心…
Dialogue: 2,0:16:48.15,0:16:49.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪！
Dialogue: 2,0:16:52.37,0:16:53.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪！
Dialogue: 2,0:16:54.47,0:16:56.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,爸爸？媽媽？
Dialogue: 2,0:16:59.95,0:17:01.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,爸爸！媽媽！
Dialogue: 2,0:17:05.12,0:17:06.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,沒事吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:17:06.45,0:17:07.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啊… 太好了
Dialogue: 2,0:17:08.47,0:17:10.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妳果然在這裡啊
Dialogue: 2,0:17:10.52,0:17:12.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,小時的情報沒錯呢
Dialogue: 2,0:17:12.87,0:17:14.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,兩位應該很忙才對
Dialogue: 2,0:17:15.02,0:17:16.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,過幾天還有重要的實驗…
Dialogue: 2,0:17:20.27,0:17:21.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,放棄了
Dialogue: 2,0:17:21.92,0:17:22.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,放棄？
Dialogue: 2,0:17:23.30,0:17:25.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,無… 無法理解
Dialogue: 2,0:17:26.02,0:17:27.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那麼好的環境
Dialogue: 2,0:17:28.25,0:17:30.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是可以實現兩位夢想的場所…
Dialogue: 2,0:17:31.20,0:17:32.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那不算什麼
Dialogue: 2,0:17:33.05,0:17:35.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,都這種時候了
Dialogue: 2,0:17:35.12,0:17:36.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你還耍什麼帥啊
Dialogue: 2,0:17:36.82,0:17:38.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你明明對高層下跪請罪
Dialogue: 2,0:17:38.95,0:17:41.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,連同我的交接資料都處理好
Dialogue: 2,0:17:42.07,0:17:43.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,急急忙忙飛到這裡來
Dialogue: 2,0:17:44.05,0:17:45.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,現在不要說那個啦
Dialogue: 2,0:17:48.07,0:17:48.75,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪
Dialogue: 2,0:17:49.35,0:17:52.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,很高興妳聲援我們的夢想
Dialogue: 2,0:17:52.77,0:17:53.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 2,0:17:53.82,0:17:56.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,如果因此無法實現阿爾瑪想做的事
Dialogue: 2,0:17:57.25,0:17:59.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那就不算是平等的家人了
Dialogue: 2,0:18:00.75,0:18:05.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我… 我就算說出這些話
Dialogue: 2,0:18:06.45,0:18:07.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,只會造成困擾
Dialogue: 2,0:18:08.37,0:18:09.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我很清楚這一點
Dialogue: 2,0:18:17.80,0:18:18.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但是我…
Dialogue: 2,0:18:23.60,0:18:24.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我想要在這裡
Dialogue: 2,0:18:25.32,0:18:27.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,和大家再次一起生活
Dialogue: 2,0:18:28.37,0:18:29.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我想要在一起！
Dialogue: 2,0:18:31.25,0:18:32.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 2,0:18:32.67,0:18:35.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對不起讓妳覺得寂寞
Dialogue: 2,0:18:46.85,0:18:49.95,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啊 再來要怎麼辦？
Dialogue: 2,0:18:50.37,0:18:51.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,都是我的錯
Dialogue: 2,0:18:51.72,0:18:54.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,讓兩位又失去了工作
Dialogue: 2,0:18:56.97,0:18:58.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,幹嘛啊好噁心
Dialogue: 2,0:19:00.47,0:19:02.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我早就知道會發生這種事！
Dialogue: 2,0:19:03.10,0:19:04.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,所以創立了…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.40,0:19:10.67,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（KAMISATO SOFTWARE股份有限公司\N開拓AI新時代 董事：神里緣司）
Dialogue: 2,0:19:04.92,0:19:06.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,新的公司！
Dialogue: 2,0:19:06.52,0:19:08.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,開拓AI時代
Dialogue: 2,0:19:08.97,0:19:10.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,KAMISATO SOFTWARE
Dialogue: 2,0:19:11.47,0:19:13.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,爸爸成了董事長嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:19:14.15,0:19:15.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對啊
Dialogue: 2,0:19:15.65,0:19:18.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我利用現在工作\N所建立的人脈和技術
Dialogue: 2,0:19:19.07,0:19:20.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,還有資金
Dialogue: 2,0:19:20.77,0:19:22.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,弄到了最新的設備！
Dialogue: 2,0:19:23.22,0:19:26.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,如果自己創業 也能自由分配時間
Dialogue: 2,0:19:26.27,0:19:28.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,怎樣？很完美的安排吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:19:30.50,0:19:31.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 2,0:19:32.00,0:19:32.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.70,0:19:39.32,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（YOBANE 機電一體 創造與人類共榮的機器人\N總經理：夜羽雀 副總：神里緣司）
Dialogue: 2,0:19:34.97,0:19:36.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,創造與人類共榮的機器人
Dialogue: 2,0:19:37.45,0:19:38.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,YOBANE 機電一體
Dialogue: 2,0:19:39.55,0:19:40.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 2,0:19:41.02,0:19:42.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妳為啥也創立了公司啊！
Dialogue: 2,0:19:43.55,0:19:46.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,誰叫你不跟我商量就自作主張！
Dialogue: 2,0:19:46.67,0:19:48.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那是我的台詞才對吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:19:48.55,0:19:50.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我是想說沒了工作
Dialogue: 2,0:19:50.82,0:19:52.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,可能會很辛苦…
Dialogue: 2,0:19:52.92,0:19:53.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,感情真好！
Dialogue: 2,0:19:55.22,0:19:58.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,, 不是的… 這是…
Dialogue: 2,0:19:59.22,0:19:59.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,小雀
Dialogue: 2,0:20:01.05,0:20:01.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,什麼啦？
Dialogue: 2,0:20:02.72,0:20:05.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,如果妳那時沒對我生氣
Dialogue: 2,0:20:06.05,0:20:08.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我一定還在猶豫吧
Dialogue: 2,0:20:09.12,0:20:12.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對我和阿爾瑪來說 妳是不可或缺的
Dialogue: 2,0:20:14.92,0:20:16.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,所以… 那個…
Dialogue: 2,0:20:18.27,0:20:18.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,和我…
Dialogue: 2,0:20:20.67,0:20:21.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我的…
Dialogue: 2,0:20:29.00,0:20:31.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,和我的公司合併吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:20:33.85,0:20:34.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 2,0:20:36.70,0:20:38.50,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,哇！你們在幹嘛啊
Dialogue: 2,0:20:38.90,0:20:41.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我們擔心阿爾瑪！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:41.52,0:20:41.90,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:44.17,0:20:46.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗨 大哥
Dialogue: 2,0:20:46.45,0:20:46.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,小時
Dialogue: 2,0:20:46.97,0:20:47.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你這沒用眼鏡仔！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:48.22,0:20:48.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:50.82,0:20:52.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,大家都很寂寞喔
Dialogue: 2,0:20:53.12,0:20:55.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,對啊 果然少了阿爾瑪
Dialogue: 2,0:20:55.72,0:20:56.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,就好無聊喔！
Dialogue: 2,0:20:57.15,0:20:58.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,老師也在等妳
Dialogue: 2,0:20:59.40,0:21:01.20,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,再一起踢足球吧！
Dialogue: 2,0:21:01.60,0:21:03.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真高興妳回來了！
Dialogue: 2,0:21:03.87,0:21:05.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯 我也很高興
Dialogue: 2,0:21:06.42,0:21:08.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪 歡迎回來
Dialogue: 2,0:21:09.92,0:21:12.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,阿爾瑪
Dialogue: 2,0:21:13.65,0:21:16.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯！大家 我回來了
Dialogue: 2,0:21:24.70,0:21:25.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真沒辦法呢
Dialogue: 2,0:21:26.25,0:21:26.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 2,0:21:27.00,0:21:29.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,公司！我會幫你的
Dialogue: 2,0:21:30.30,0:21:32.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你不是不能沒有我嗎？
Dialogue: 2,0:21:37.37,0:21:38.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我說妳啊
Dialogue: 2,0:21:39.02,0:21:41.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,說過多少次了 要依照資料夾整理資料
Dialogue: 2,0:21:41.92,0:21:44.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,-愛計較的男人不受歡迎喔\N-一起玩吧
Dialogue: 2,0:21:44.45,0:21:45.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,妳說啥？
Dialogue: 2,0:21:45.25,0:21:45.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,怎樣啦！
Dialogue: 2,0:21:46.82,0:21:47.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我出門了
Dialogue: 2,0:21:47.95,0:21:49.72,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,爸爸 媽媽
Dialogue: 2,0:21:50.47,0:21:51.40,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,路上小心
Dialogue: 2,0:21:51.95,0:21:52.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,要小心喔
Dialogue: 2,0:21:53.27,0:21:54.02,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.92,0:21:55.17,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,{\an8}（阿爾瑪股份有限公司\NALMA technology）
